    "credit_salary": {
      "source_index": 26,
      "index": 26,
      "doc": " Credit `amount` of salary from the saga treasury into a character's wallet.\n The off-chain settle computes the per-char amount (budget/perfPool split,\n settle.ts) and passes it in; the undistributed remainder stays in the\n treasury (carryover). Gated by StorytellerCap AND the character must belong\n to this saga (assert_cap only binds cap→saga, NOT saga→character — without\n this a StorytellerCap could drain the treasury into any character object).",
      "attributes": [],
      "visibility": "Public",
