    "collect_daily_cost": {
      "source_index": 27,
      "index": 27,
      "doc": " Debit `requested` dailyCost (computed off-chain) from a character's wallet\n into the protocol sink. Pays `bmin(balance, requested)` — never overdraws —\n and returns `insolvent` (paid < requested), matching settle.ts:114-118.\n Vitality/death are NOT applied here (off-chain D5). StorytellerCap-gated +\n saga-bound (same authority binding as credit_salary).",
